rule refund_fee v1
description "The fee a refund costs, by how the items come back: written for the tests of yuen affected. A line of the shop adds a way from a file of its own"

enum way = post "By post" | counter "At the counter"  open

inputs
  way : way

outputs
  fee : number  round down(1)

table fee open
policy unique
| way     | -> fee : number |
| post    | 5               |
| counter | 0               |

examples
| way     | -> fee |
| post    | 5      |
| counter | 0      |
